{
    "title": "Academy Sports + Outdoors",
    "description": "Shop Academy Sports + Outdoors while on-the-go. Take your game to the next level right from your phone and shop for high-quality sports gear from all the top brands. Prepare for your next outdoor adventure and gear up right from your living room or desk. The app makes it easy to shop on your time and find the best value. \r\n\r\nUse the app to find stores near you along with exclusive offers, both online and in-store. Real-time updates keep you in the loop for savings and scan bar codes to get in-depth product details and pricing info.  For extra convenience, choose the pickup or shipping method that works best for you. \r\n\r\nApp Features:\r\n\u2022\tFull shopping experience: Get real-time updates about offers, deals, and other ways to save for the top-quality sports + outdoor essentials from the brands you trust.\r\n\u2022\tChoose where and how to get the fun started: The store locator feature helps you find your nearest neighborhood Academy and get curbside convenience or in-store pickup. \r\n\u2022\tBarcode scanning in-store for more: No more guesswork with prices or product details. Scan barcodes while shopping in-store for full product overviews and customer reviews. \r\n\u2022\tKeep track of your buys with digital receipts: Wave goodbye to paper receipts and get digital copies of your app, online, and in-store purchase receipts sent to your Academy.com account.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Shop Academy Sports + Outdoors while on-the-go. Take your game to the next level right from your phone and shop for high-quality sports gear from all the top brands. Prepare for your next outdoor adventure and gear up right from your living room or desk. The app makes it easy to shop on your time and find the best value. <br><br>Use the app to find stores near you along with exclusive offers, both online and in-store. Real-time updates keep you in the loop for savings and scan bar codes to get in-depth product details and pricing info.  For extra convenience, choose the pickup or shipping method that works best for you. <br><br>App Features:<br>\u2022\tFull shopping experience: Get real-time updates about offers, deals, and other ways to save for the top-quality sports + outdoor essentials from the brands you trust.<br>\u2022\tChoose where and how to get the fun started: The store locator feature helps you find your nearest neighborhood Academy and get curbside convenience or in-store pickup. <br>\u2022\tBarcode scanning in-store for more: No more guesswork with prices or product details. Scan barcodes while shopping in-store for full product overviews and customer reviews. <br>\u2022\tKeep track of your buys with digital receipts: Wave goodbye to paper receipts and get digital copies of your app, online, and in-store purchase receipts sent to your Academy.com account.",
